                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/releases/tag/12.2.0"&gt;v12.2.0: More Popup fixes!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;Some more fixes related to Popup and then some... Also, this release reinstates the assembly versioning that got lost in translation somewhere. Most people probably didn't even notice or care. But if you're one of the people who does... Now its fixed!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adds installation instructions to README by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/VladislavAntonyuk/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/VladislavAntonyuk"&gt;@VladislavAntonyuk&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3211671686" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/2797" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2797/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2797"&gt;#2797&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fire &lt;code&gt;Action PopupOptions.OnTappingOutsideOfPopup&lt;/code&gt; when Android Back Button Pressed by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TheCodeTraveler/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TheCodeTraveler"&gt;@TheCodeTraveler&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3213069482" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/2799" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2799/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2799"&gt;#2799&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prevent Popup From Being Dismissed when Tapped Inside Popup by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/bijington/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/bijington"&gt;@bijington&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3213415853" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/2800" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2800/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2800"&gt;#2800&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reinstate assembly versioning by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jfversluis/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jfversluis"&gt;@jfversluis&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3274763217" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/2837" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2837/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2837"&gt;#2837&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refactor TextCaseConverter and enhance ListToStringConverterTests by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/waheez/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/waheez"&gt;@waheez&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3286289184" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/2840" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2840/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/2840"&gt;#2840&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
